# Unity project Git ignore template (selected safe defaults).
# Reference: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
# Place at the Unity project root. If an existing .gitignore exists, MERGE;
# do not replace rules, remove tracked files, or override Git LFS policies.
# Paths beginning with / are relative to this .gitignore's directory.

# Unity-generated cache, temporary content, builds and per-user settings
.utmp/
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Editor and Android tooling local caches
.vs/
.gradle/
.idea/
.consulo/
ExportedObj/
*.DotSettings.user
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs

# Unity-generated IDE project/solution files (enabled by default).
# Adjust these rules if the project intentionally tracks custom solutions.
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx

# Unity-generated UI Toolkit schema and scene dependency caches
/UIElementsSchema/
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]ceneDependencyCache*

# Unity-generated crash/debug information
mono_crash.*
sysinfo.txt
/*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
/*_BackUpThisFolder_ButDontShipItWithYourGame/

# Project-dependent options: enable ONLY after confirming generated content.
# Addressables content state may be required for content-update workflows.
# /[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/addressables_content_state.bin
# /[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/addressables_content_state.bin.meta
# /[Aa]ssets/Addressables_Temp/
# /[Aa]ssets/StreamingAssets/aa/
# /ServerData/
# EDM4U-generated repository (if not intentionally tracked):
# /[Aa]ssets/GeneratedLocalRepo/
# Exported Android/Unity packages (some teams intentionally version them):
# *.apk
# *.aab
# *.obb
# *.unitypackage

# Do NOT ignore Assets/, .meta, Packages/, ProjectSettings/, UXML, USS,
# PanelSettings, fonts, or other files needed to reproduce the project.
